            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "KristaInDenver"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Everyone at the BBQ we attended loved this dessert. It truly does remind you of a Dairy Queen Peanut Buster Parfait. The sauce wasn't as thick as I would like, so I'll use a bit less evaporated milk and more chocolate chips next time. I also recommend starting the sauce mixture first, prior to crushing the Oreos, to give the sauce enough time to cool completely. As with others who tried this, while I thought the sauce was completely cool, it melted the ice cream somewhat.",
